(7560546, 1211327, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge<br/> <br/>One minute you''re swimming around without a care in the world, and the next Great action capture Tom, presumably from the same or similar sequence to your triptych? It''s nice to see so close up but therein lies the problem in that perhaps you have cropped too close and the sharpness is not quite there. I do think your image was well worthy of comment and disappointed for you that no-one else contributed during the challenge but perhaps thats confirmation of my own comments? Anyway, still a great shot Tom, thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the open challenge One minute you''re swimming around without a care in the world, and the next Great action capture Tom, presumably from the same or similar sequence to your triptych? It''s nice to see so close up but therein lies the problem in that perhaps you have cropped too close and the sharpness is not quite there. I do think your image was well worthy of comment and disappointed for you that no-one else contributed during the challenge but perhaps thats confirmation of my own comments? Anyway, still a great shot Tom, thanks for sharing.', '2018-02-23 10:52:15.000000', NULL, 0),
